    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Minh Man Tony Ha",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107167643329401165236/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVvwPwMXze_7G5o5yjqsxi2JfOw1WtboOm_jroGMx7wB4qouBI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Great experience with Jeanne and her work. The quality of the embroidery is excellent (clean stitching, great attention to detail) and exactly what I was hoping for.\n\nThe service was friendly and professional and the turnaround time was quick. I’m very happy to support a local business that delivers high-quality work. I’ll definitely be coming back and highly recommend them!",
        "time": 1765816714,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Anna Hwang",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102552490041074696386/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVTbmzJp8AwsUkgi5Q-z2YBR8bglHxDgyJJC1XKfPgqaSZHj72w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "I am beyond satisfied with the work Jeanne did for me! From the very beginning, she made the process smooth and easy. Communication was a breeze, and she really took the time to understand my vision. Jeanne was able to bring my idea to life with such precision and care. The embroidery work is absolutely stunning, and I couldn't be happier with the final result. On top of that, her pricing is very fair. I would definitely use her services again and highly recommend her to anyone looking for custom, high-quality embroidery work!",
        "time": 1756565863,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Dawn Ambris",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111912080362690742801/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWSEFri_vo8BwqxrbUf1IiXGopbwGGY9wF65_8c3N5Ypf5P7ZuQ2Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "Professional and great experience! I wanted my son's name embroidered on a towel for his birthday and Jeanne did just that. He absolutely LOVED it! Highly recommend. I will definitely return and use her services for any future embroidery projects. Thank you!",
        "time": 1747604077,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ally",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101094777040556954566/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJkUaonx2kTjEcOL-0S5zCqVa5eOGlsJH8Lsbp6pYf_HCqp_Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Absolutely love the custom made sweaters i got.\nThey followed all instructions and even sent me a message to make sure all names were correct.\nAlso fast shipping :)\nThank you so much",
        "time": 1714596892,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Aya Dia",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110719487989117088704/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVGwRtS75ngJUYk1_D5NTMGBOvdoPAjzlLHuoyhf3xUfGZZ7O3C=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "\"I had a fantastic experience with the custom store ! The quality of their embroidery work is top-notch, and their attention to detail is impressive. They were able to bring my custom design to life exactly as I envisioned. The turnaround time was quicker than I expected, and their customer service was friendly and professional. Highly recommend them for any of your embroidery needs!\"",
